{"segs": ["PA_ja_25:0.2", "PA_ja_25:0.3"], "en": "The First Book, The Section on Antelopes (Kuruṅgavagga)", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_25:0.4"], "en": "5. The Titthajātakam:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_25:1.1", "PA_ja_25:1.2"], "en": "“O charioteer, let us drink from various watering places.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_25:1.3"], "en": "“A man is satisfied even with a seat of straw,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
